---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope, and the parts that are not Apache-2.0
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apache-2.0 covers the CVQR/1 tooling, the decoder application code, and the
artwork generators in this repository.

FORMAT.md is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0. A file format that
cannot be freely copied into someone else's documentation is not really an open
format, and the entire purpose of CVQR/1 is that a stranger can reimplement it
without asking anyone.

Third-party components, unmodified, under their own terms:

  Codec2 — LGPL-2.1 — David Rowe — github.com/drowe67/codec2
    See LICENSES/codec2-LGPL-2.1.txt. The WebAssembly build shipped in
    decoder/vendor/ is a compiled form of Codec2. LGPL-2.1 requires that a
    recipient be able to modify and relink it: decoder/vendor/BUILD.md gives
    the exact upstream commit, the exact compiler version, and the exact
    command, so any recipient can rebuild it from source and substitute their
    own binary.

  jsQR — Apache-2.0 — Cosmo Wolfe — github.com/cozmo/jsQR
    See LICENSES/jsQR-Apache-2.0.txt. Unmodified dist build.
